Paired local_arena runs, v3 (A) vs v2 (B), alternating seats, 0 crashes and
0 illegal selects in every run. --seed only seeds Python's RNG, which the cg
engine's shuffles do not draw from, so these are independent samples of one
number rather than distinct pinned seeds; only the pooled row is meaningful.

